Replace-From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Replace-Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:43:47 +0800
Subject: media: platform: add the build hooks for the HiSTB media drivers

The HiSTB media drivers have no place in drivers/media/platform.
Each family keeps its own directory with a Kconfig and a Makefile of its
own.
Add the vendor directory, hook it into the platform Kconfig and
Makefile, and source the decoder's Kconfig first.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 3 files changed, 7 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/Kconfig


diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/Kconfig b/drivers/media/platform/Kconfig
index 2c7699b6610b..003de45ff5c1 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/Kconfig
@@ -73,6 +73,7 @@ source "drivers/media/platform/broadcom/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/cadence/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/chips-media/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/dreamchip/Kconfig"
+source "drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/imagination/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/intel/Kconfig"
 source "drivers/media/platform/marvell/Kconfig"
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/Makefile b/drivers/media/platform/Makefile
index d47c47d817da..56d33c62aa15 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/Makefile
@@ -16,6 +16,7 @@ obj-y += broadcom/
 obj-y += cadence/
 obj-y += chips-media/
 obj-y += dreamchip/
+obj-y += hisilicon/
 obj-y += imagination/
 obj-y += intel/
 obj-y += marvell/
diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/Kconfig b/drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/Kconfig
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..8a030313b416
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/Kconfig
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later OR MIT
+
+comment "HiSilicon media platform drivers"
+
+source "drivers/media/platform/hisilicon/histb-vdec/Kconfig"
